  "title": "Clarke Cheesecake Pie",
  "description": "This pie is a snap to make. Cream cheese, milk, vanilla and lots of lemon juice are blended until smooth and creamy. Then the mixture is poured into a graham cracker crust and chilled for a few hours. Garnish with mint and lemon slices.",
